# ESP-IDF build output for the wall panel's firmware.
#
# The image that a person flashes is firmware/companion/prebuilt, which CI
# writes and git carries. This is the working directory of a build somebody
# makes themselves, which the page prefers when it is there and which nobody
# else needs. The installer still carries it to the toolbox copy, because
# copy_toolbox lays the working tree over the clone.
firmware/companion/build/
firmware/companion/sdkconfig
firmware/companion/sdkconfig.old
firmware/companion/managed_components/
